WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:02.905
Hello.

2
00:00:02.905 --> 00:00:05.661
Who

3
00:00:05.662 --> 00:00:10.000
are you? I'm

4
00:00:10.001 --> 00:00:13.935
a turkey vulture. We

5
00:00:13.936 --> 00:00:17.986
are raptors. Raptors

6
00:00:17.987 --> 00:00:22.479
are birds that hunt for food. Where

7
00:00:22.480 --> 00:00:25.201
do you live? We

8
00:00:25.202 --> 00:00:29.059
live in North America. We

9
00:00:29.060 --> 00:00:34.456
like open places like fields. What

10
00:00:34.457 --> 00:00:37.041
do you eat? Turkey

11
00:00:37.042 --> 00:00:40.823
vultures eat dead animals. We

12
00:00:40.824 --> 00:00:44.390
can smell very well. We

13
00:00:44.391 --> 00:00:53.054
smell to find food. Yikes!

14
00:00:53.055 --> 00:00:58.544
You eat dead animals? Yes.

15
00:00:58.545 --> 00:01:02.836
We are a big help to nature. We

16
00:01:02.837 --> 00:01:06.184
clean up fields and roads. And

17
00:01:06.185 --> 00:01:10.738
we never attack living animals.

18
00:01:10.739 --> 00:01:13.703
Do you live alone?

19
00:01:13.704 --> 00:01:15.445
Nope!

20
00:01:15.446 --> 00:01:19.087
Turkey vultures often eat together.

21
00:01:19.088 --> 00:01:23.179
We fly and sleep together too.

22
00:01:23.180 --> 00:01:26.559
Your beak looks sharp!

23
00:01:26.560 --> 00:01:30.367
Our beaks are very sharp.

24
00:01:30.368 --> 00:01:33.500
They help us eat.

25
00:01:33.501 --> 00:01:37.282
We can even eat big animals.

26
00:01:37.283 --> 00:01:39.952
Do you build nests?

27
00:01:39.953 --> 00:01:43.472
We don't build real nests.

28
00:01:43.473 --> 00:01:47.570
We look for holes in rocks or logs.

29
00:01:47.571 --> 00:01:52.386
We like old buildings and caves too.

30
00:01:52.387 --> 00:01:57.804
I'm hungry again. Bye!

31
00:01:57.805 --> 00:02:04.539
See you later, Turkey Vulture!

